<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Iframe Showcase</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>🖼️ Iframe Showcase</h1>
  <p>This page demonstrates how an iframe can display content from another source directly inside a webpage.</p>

  <h2>Play the Game Inside the Page</h2>
  <p>Enjoy the interactive game below without opening a separate tab or window.</p>

  <iframe
    src="https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/60917032/embed"
    width="500"
    height="400"
    allowtransparency="true"
    frameborder="0"
    scrolling="no"
    allowfullscreen>
  </iframe>

  <h2>Why Use an Iframe?</h2>
  <p>The <strong>iframe</strong> tag lets us embed videos, games, maps, and other webpages inside our own HTML document.</p>

</body>
</html>
